{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is It?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anima Codex is your world building and story telling companion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intuitive tool designed for Writers, Gamemasters and Creators who want to bring their universe to life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who's it for?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Novelists and Writers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Developers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Masters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative Thinkers</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Builder - Create and Describe your Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factions Creator - Make Nations and Countries in your Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location Manager - Describe Regions, Cities and Landmarks in as much detail as you desire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Profiles - Track relationships, personalities, roles and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Library -\u00a0 Document relics, tools and artifacts important to your setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest Editor - Create Quests, with Rewards, Objectives and More</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes - For making General Purpose Notes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspector - Easy and simple to use inspector loading system</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional notes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This software is being developed by one person and I am always looking for feedback and suggestions. I'd be honored to receive any feedback and suggestions posted in the Steam forum section and Discord.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4150380?t=1767309775","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150380/550838a4f6fe5fbc2b0650d107b8c1c49239b207/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767309775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150380/11162dd2a14d6abad7aa912a62745f7aa0926396/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767309775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150380/11162dd2a14d6abad7aa912a62745f7aa0926396/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767309775","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is It?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anima Codex is your world building and story telling companion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intuitive tool designed for Writers, Gamemasters and Creators who want to bring their universe to life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who's it for?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Novelists and Writers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Developers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Masters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative Thinkers</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Builder - Create and Describe your Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factions Creator - Make Nations and Countries in your Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location Manager - Describe Regions, Cities and Landmarks in as much detail as you desire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Profiles - Track relationships, personalities, roles and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Library -\u00a0 Document relics, tools and artifacts important to your setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest Editor - Create Quests, with Rewards, Objectives and More</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes - For making General Purpose Notes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspector - Easy and simple to use inspector loading system</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional notes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This software is being developed by one person and I am always looking for feedback and suggestions. I'd be honored to receive any feedback and suggestions posted in the Steam forum section and Discord.</p>","developers":["Kraheahn"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150380/b0c4f76e9cc0c21abd5e53fdab061dfa2502bd51/header.jpg?t=1767309775","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Anima Codex","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDEA GeForce GTX Super <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Kraheahn"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"30 Nov, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150380/4d73a7cf2a4d81981a99f571604c23bc084ee876/ss_4d73a7cf2a4d81981a99f571604c23bc084ee876.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767309775","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150380/4d73a7cf2a4d81981a99f571604c23bc084ee876/ss_4d73a7cf2a4d81981a99f571604c23bc084ee876.600x338.jpg?t=1767309775"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150380/bcc927192c9b8cf2e5622953f2318cd030e9246c/ss_bcc927192c9b8cf2e5622953f2318cd030